<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12451" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδέω</span></b>  (B), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be in want of, lack,</i> often in accounts of
			numbers, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριακοσίων ἀποδέοντα μύρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					10
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				000
			</span></i>
			<i>lacking</i> or <i>save</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				300
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.13
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.38
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυεῖν χιλιάδων ἀποδέοντες εἶναι
					δισμύριοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					7.3
				</span></i>
			; generally, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοσοῦτον ἀποδέω
			τινός</span> so <i>far am</i> I <i>from . .,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				366b
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				372a
			</span></i>: c. inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλίγον
				ἀποδεῖν εἶναι</span>
			<i>want</i> little <i>of</i> being, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.978f
			</span></i>; <i>fall short of, be inferior to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
					36
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1088c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλήθει οὐ πολὺ ἀποδέοντες
				ἀλλήλων</span> not <i>differing</i> much in number, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				3.52
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Luc.</u>
				28
			</span></i>; <i>come short of, miss,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἀληθείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ax.</u>
					369d
				</span></i>
			.</div>
